WEBVTT

00:18:59.356 --> 00:19:02.116
That gave you some cool, too.

00:19:02.156 --> 00:19:03.396
(Laughter)

00:19:04.036 --> 00:19:05.396
But a quick follow up,

00:19:05.436 --> 00:19:06.836
how do you, like,

00:19:06.876 --> 00:19:10.556
with all that going on,
with those horrifying threats,

00:19:10.556 --> 00:19:12.916
how do you unwind from all this?

00:19:12.916 --> 00:19:16.196
How do you, you know, keep it together

00:19:16.236 --> 00:19:18.676
and give yourself some space to breathe?

00:19:19.116 --> 00:19:22.596
AF: Well, I have an extraordinarily
supportive family,

00:19:22.636 --> 00:19:24.796
my wife who's with me,

00:19:24.836 --> 00:19:28.316
my children are grown and live
in different parts of the country.

00:19:28.316 --> 00:19:32.636
But they are very supportive
of me with texts and calls